TITLE Pure water pH 7 at 150C equilibrated with chrysotile and talc; pe from O2(g)=1 atm
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
    O2(g)      0 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file peq3.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
